aodi-q-o097-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-52e60e18f7f0053e43d5","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“仲尼言‘唯天为大，唯尧则之’〖8〗。尧之大美，在乎则天；顺考古道，非其至也〖9〗。今发篇开义，以明圣德；而舍其大，更称其细，岂作者之意邪？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":447,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o098","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5cfe4a7ae6a38daf9785","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“臣奉遵师说，未喻大义。至于折中〖10〗，裁之圣思。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":448,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o098-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5cfe4a7ae6a38daf9785","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“臣奉遵师说，未喻大义。至于折中〖10〗，裁之圣思。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":448,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o099-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-140c41eaae49b40b285c","layer":"original","quote":"次及四岳举鲧〖11〗。帝又问曰：“夫大人者，与天地合其德，与日月合其明；思无不周，明无不照。今王肃云‘尧意不能明鲧〖12〗，是以试用’。如此，圣人之明有所未尽邪？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o100","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-592beac8e701f5d7bccf","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“虽圣人之弘，犹有所未尽。故禹曰‘知人则哲，惟帝难之’〖13〗。然卒能改授圣贤〖14〗，缉熙庶绩〖15〗，亦所以成圣也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":450,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o100-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-592beac8e701f5d7bccf","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“虽圣人之弘，犹有所未尽。故禹曰‘知人则哲，惟帝难之’〖13〗。然卒能改授圣贤〖14〗，缉熙庶绩〖15〗，亦所以成圣也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":450,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o101-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-29b9d0bf354da00fedf1","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“夫有始有卒〖16〗，其唯圣人；若不能始，何以为圣？其言‘惟帝难之’，然卒能改授；盖谓知人圣人所难，非不尽之言也。《经》云：‘知人则哲，能官人。’〖17〗若尧疑鲧，试之九年；官人失叙〖18〗，何得谓之圣哲？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":451,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o102","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2c38896c104c1f5bdf24","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“臣窃观经传〖19〗，圣人行事不能无失；是以尧失之四凶〖20〗，周公失之二叔〖21〗，仲尼失之宰予〖22〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o102-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2c38896c104c1f5bdf24","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“臣窃观经传〖19〗，圣人行事不能无失；是以尧失之四凶〖20〗，周公失之二叔〖21〗，仲尼失之宰予〖22〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o103-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-75d7fbd759f2700ff206","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“尧之任鲧，九载无成，汩陈五行〖23〗，民用昏垫〖24〗；至于仲尼失之宰予，言行之间〖25〗：轻重不同也。至于周公、管、蔡之事，亦《尚书》所载，皆博士所当通也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o104","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0b28e67ad0eec346a605","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“此皆先贤所疑，非臣寡见所能究论。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o104-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0b28e67ad0eec346a605","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“此皆先贤所疑，非臣寡见所能究论。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o105-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-fb0971dac6f07b4a73d0","layer":"original","quote":"次及“有鳏在下曰虞舜”〖26〗，帝问曰：“当尧之时，洪水为害，四凶在朝，宜速登贤圣济斯民之时也〖27〗。舜年在既立〖28〗，圣德光明；而久不进用，何也？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o106","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-66de000f4568be1c5bf6","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“尧咨嗟求贤〖29〗，欲逊己位；岳曰‘否德忝帝位’〖30〗。尧复使岳扬举仄陋〖31〗，然后荐舜。荐舜之本，实由于尧；此盖圣人欲尽众心也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o106-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-66de000f4568be1c5bf6","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“尧咨嗟求贤〖29〗，欲逊己位；岳曰‘否德忝帝位’〖30〗。尧复使岳扬举仄陋〖31〗，然后荐舜。荐舜之本，实由于尧；此盖圣人欲尽众心也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o107-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-23039d72fce7948c75af","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“尧既闻舜而不登用，又时忠臣亦不进达；乃使岳扬仄陋而后荐举，非急于用圣恤民之谓也〖32〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o108","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ea02de02181603dc2339","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“非臣愚见所能逮及。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o108-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ea02de02181603dc2339","layer":"original","quote":"峻对曰：“非臣愚见所能逮及。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":458,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
